Gemini golden files generated against the OpenAI-compatible surface
(https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/openai).

These inputs are NOT generated by running LiteLLM (see plan §14). They
encode the documented OpenAI-compatible wire format Google exposes for
Gemini. Divergences from LiteLLM's Python transforms are intentional
where LiteLLM is known to be buggy; the provider's official docs are
authoritative.
